From: VS Sharp <noreply@vssharp>
Subject: Bypass NU1903 error for Nerdbank.MessagePack 1.0.2

Nerdbank.MessagePack 1.0.2 has a security advisory (NU1903) that triggers
"warning as error" in DotRush's strict build. We can't easily bump it
without upstream changes, so demote it to a regular warning.

Re-apply after pulling a new DotRush upstream pin.

--- a/src/Common.Build.props
+++ b/src/Common.Build.props
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@
         <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);NUnit2045</NoWarn>
         <AssetsPath>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\extension\bin\</AssetsPath>
         <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
-        <WarningsAsErrors>$(WarningsAsErrors);NU1903;NU1904</WarningsAsErrors>
+        <WarningsAsErrors>$(WarningsAsErrors);NU1904</WarningsAsErrors>
+        <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);NU1903</NoWarn>
     </PropertyGroup>

